%N A400444 Smallest square in a corner of a simple perfect squared rectangle of order n.
%C A400444 a(9) = 9 is the only known appearance of 9 in a corner of a simple perfect squared rectangle (SPSR). Terms for n = 9..26 agree with the table of smallest corner squares for SPSR by order on squaring.net
%H A400444 Stuart E. Anderson, <a href="https://www.squaring.net/sq/sr/spsr/spsr_boundary.html">Simple Perfects by Boundary Rules and Conditions</a>.
